{"name":"UL-Classified replacement circuit breaker cross-reference by panel brand","description":"Residential circuit breakers that Underwriters Laboratories has Classified for use in a different manufacturer's load centre, taken from each manufacturer's own catalog. Each record is one classified breaker: its own catalog number, its ampere rating, and the competing brands' breakers it is listed to replace. Answers 'my panel is a Square D and the supply house only has Eaton in stock — what fits'. There is no single public database of this because UL Classification is tested breaker-by-breaker and every manufacturer publishes only its own outbound mapping, never the full grid across competitors.","url":"https://referencesource.org/ul-classified-circuit-breaker-cross-reference-by-brand/","licence":"factual compilation from manufacturer catalogs","last_verified":"2026-08-26","stale_after":"2028-08-25","sources":["https://s3.amazonaws.com/globalthesource/pdfcatalog/151/Circuit_Breakers_CL_Classified.pdf","https://contractor.compas.siemens-info.com/assets/speedfax/SF17_Sect01.pdf"],"records":[{"classifying_brand":"Eaton","classified_part_number":"CL115","amp_rating":"15","square_d_equivalent":"HOM115","crouse_hinds_equivalent":"MP115","general_electric_equivalent":"THQL115","ite_siemens_equivalent":"Q115","murray_equivalent":"MP115","thomas_betts_equivalent":"TB115","id":"eaton-cl115","url":"https://referencesource.org/ul-classified-circuit-breaker-cross-reference-by-brand/eaton-cl115/","source":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/globalthesource/pdfcatalog/151/Circuit_Breakers_CL_Classified.pdf","source_quote":"CL115         1         15           10         HOM115               MP115    THQL115    Q115     MP115     TB115","verified_fields":["amp_rating","classified_part_number","classifying_brand","crouse_hinds_equivalent","general_electric_equivalent","ite_siemens_equivalent","murray_equivalent","square_d_equivalent","thomas_betts_equivalent"]},{"classifying_brand":"Eaton","cla